    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Besaleli nee Oholiabu gadiyeé ngi tleehhiye', dinkwa nee umuúqo hhawaatuú sagalooár kooma, oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa sagalooár i haniís nee fuquraango, as xu'utír gadiyér heémaadár Mungú sleémeero ngiwa aslay, nee as sagadiyuusi'iimár hhoohhoo' ar adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira hara'ayín.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose, Besaleli nee Oholiabu nee umuúqo heé fuqurángw kooma, oo ta sagalooár i haniís nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, nee umuúqo heé baraá muunaáwose taa tliw/ina, giri ateét as gadiyeérí ngiwa tleehhiya' ar sla'aari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín ohmeedá' sleémeero ngiri ilaoohiyé' dír Mose wa alé, ohmeerí an tidá' tinda duúx nee múk Israeli ar sla'aari as gadiyér didá' hhoohhoo'. Aluudae muu ina kumiít ohme huwahubuwo, umuúqo looár tlawa adoorí ngina tleehhiyé' ar muunuú sla'aari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As adoorí mukdá' sleémeero oo sagalooár koóm oo gadiyér didá' hhoohhoo' ga tleehha, gadiyeeduuín ngari geexayé', tari tláy ay amór Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguri bayé', «Muu muruú tinda huúw ku yaariír, tam qoomaydá' bu'uút didá' hhoohhoo' tleehhamooro guri harwaaráhh, kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ naa atén i hara'ayín.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose iri ya/abín baraá maraay sleémeero muu kuwa bay, «Umuúqo heewo ta hhawaatá laqaá ta /ameeni matawa kumiít ohme burumburingo as didaádá' hhoohhoo'.» Muu kuri ilaá/ ohme huwahubuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma muruudá' taa burumbuúr sleémeero i bu'uút gadiyeédá' tleéhharo nee iri harwaraáhh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hhawaate sleémeero kudá' taa qo sagalooár i haniís, heémadá' hhoohhoo' ngiri tleehhiyé' ar kaeemaá mibaangw awa inqwaruú taa tleéhh ar kitaánír hhohho', nee ar tlabaá taa tleéhh ar neewór sirbo/ ar se'éngw bee/aangw, nee ar sirda/aten, nee ar da/aten, slaqsa'aá keruúbi kiri gawaadí tleéhh, nee heé tleehhamooro gu baál. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo inqwaariro tlenaangós a har miíta mibaá nee tsár, nee tlenángw bihhe a miíta tsár. Kaeemooká' sleémeero i alqoná'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kaeemaá kooán giri hiriít dinkwár i ale, as ngiwa wak tleehhi, nee awa hatlá' kooán giri malé adoorí laáq. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlin'aá sirbó/ giri hiriít baraá alhhe'eesoó ka'amír wák ar bartá wák i dirii', tlin'aá hatlá' giri hiriít baraá alhhe'eesoó ka'amír hatlá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlin'aá mibeeraá kooán giri hiriít baraá ka'amír wák, nee awa hatlá' mibeeri kooán giri hiriít baraá ka'amír tsár tlin'iiká' sleémeero i afiqoná'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo muqslár afe mogól ar mibeeraá kooán ar sahaábu gari tleéhh as kaeemoodá' tsaraawo ngiwa haraagasi, naagáy kaeemoodá' tsaraawo giri heémár wák tleéhh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo tuuntukmár heémaadá' gari tleéhh ar se'éngw aara, kaeemo ngaa tleéhh a mibaá nee wak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo ka'amiro tlenaangós a miíta mibaá nee tám, nee uroó bihheero a miíta tsár. Kaeemoodá' sleémeero i alqoná'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy kaeemaá kooán giri dinkwaárií hiriít, nee kaeemaá lahhoó' giri dinkwaárií hiriít sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo tlin'aá mibeeraá kooán giri hiriít baraá ka'amír wák, nee awa hatlá' mibeeri kooán gawaá ka'amír tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo muqslár afe mogól mibeeraá kooán gári tleéhh, ar muqslár sirdaa/aten as kahhó' kaeemooká' tsár kiwa haragaasi. Daqaní ka'ami tari wák ar heéma tuuntuuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluudae tuuntukma gari malé tleéhh ar kadaá gwaandaawe awa natsatsa'aá' awa taa da/teemiís. Tuuntukmár hatlá' gari malé tleéhh ar kadaá natsaatsaa'á' awa aara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluudae sihhteeraá masqaryaandi giri tleéhh as kiwa sihhin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo sihhtamoowo tlenaangós a miíta tsiyáhh, nee yaangareemaawós a sentimiíta mibeeri lahhoó' nee lahhoó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo sihhtamoowo guna tlaqáfuú tsár i tleéhh, as kahhó' sihhteeri tiwa oohiya'. Sihhteeri sleémeero awa heémaadá' gina tlaqáfií tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sihhteeraá mibeeraá tsár gina siíhh ar bihhaá basa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yukumoó muqslár peésa guri tleéhh, yukumáy ngwaa tleéhh a mibeeri tsiyáhh, umuúqo sihhtamoowo yukumáy a tsár as tlaqáfuudá' nguwa oohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bihhaa /iya awa heémaro sihhteeri ngaa tleéhh a mibeeri tsár sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yukumoó muqslár peésa oo sihhteeriidá' ngwa tleéhh a mibeeri tsiyáhh, umuúqo sihhtamoowo yukumáy tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bihhaá /uwaawo, amoodár alaá heémaro sihhteeri ngaa tleéhh a lahhoó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sihhteeraá tsár giri tleéhh as qul/ayduú alaá heéma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sihhteeriiká' tsaraawo baraaywo niwa tlayé' kaa haragaasiiká, tiri doogiyá' dír tseegár geera ar heéma. Sihhteeraá tsár umuú barto kina adoorír tleéhh as qul/oó heéma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sihhteeri dinkwaaro a dakaát, nee yukumáy'ín a mibaá nee lahhoó' kudá' taa tleéhh ar muqslár peésa, umuúqo sihhtamoowo a yukumáy tsár.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waqasuú kooán oo masqaryaandi guri tleéhh as nguwa qaasi ar sagér sihhteeraá bihhaá wák. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee waqasuú kooán as sihhteeraá bartá hatlá' ar heémaadá', nee waqasuú kooán as sihhteeraá alaá heémár hará' bihhaá /uwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqaasír hatlá' gari tleéhh ar tla/ángw heéma gur oh, bartí wa tleemu ay bartaqá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sihhteeri sleémeero giri ninkiriíts ar sahaábu, waqas guri tseék ar qutúrú sahaábu gawaá sihhteerií ale. Waqas sleeme guri ninkiriíts ar sahaábu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo inqwar guri tleéhh ar neewór sirbo/ nee ar sirda/aten nee ar da/atene, nee neewór taa hhuútl ar kitaánír hhohho', inqwaaridá' kari slaqsoó keruúbírí hiriít. Gadiyeérí kana tleéhh nee heé ga tlehhma baál. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uheemaá tsiyáhh awa masqaryaán giri tleéhh, gari sahaábúr ninkiriíts giri muqslár afe mogólií tleéhh ar sahaábu. Yukumoó tsiyáhh oo peésa guri tleéhh as uheemidá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inqwaarír ta afkú doó heémár wa qaasi gari tleéhh, gár ngira tleéhh a neewór se'éngw bee/aangw ar sirbo/, nee ar sirdaa/aten, nee ar da/aten, nee neewór taa hhuútl ar kitaánír hhohho'. Inqwaaridá' sleeme kari parootuús kángw kilá' wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uheemaá kooán giri tleéhh nee dungáy'ine. Sagér uheemiidá' gari ninkiriíts ar sahaábu nee dungáydá'. Ala yukumoó kooán guri tleéhh ar muqslír sirdaa/aat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
